<title>USA: Ormet raises aluminum coil sheet products tags.</title>
<headline>Ormet raises aluminum coil sheet products tags.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ormet Aluminum Mill Products, part of Ormet Corp, said it has raised by three cents per pound its prices for aluminum coil sheet products.</p>
<p>The hike applies to all new orders received on or after December 23.</p>
<p>Ormet said in a statement the increase was applicable to both production and distribution depot orders.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
